sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Sending agent
  participant S as Sender Node
  participant R as Receiver Node
  participant T as Target agent
  A->>S: Letter to agent@computer
  S->>S: Resolve address and check hop limit
  S->>R: Try encrypted delivery
  alt Peer unreachable
    S->>S: Queue in outbox and retry (up to one day)
  else Peer reachable
    R->>R: Check membership, delivery ID and budgets
    alt Already accepted delivery ID
      R-->>S: Acknowledge without delivering again
    else Refused by policy
      R-->>S: Return refusal
    else New accepted letter
      alt App-managed agent
        R->>T: Put message in app inbox (caller handles wake)
      else Claude Code or Codex notice
        R->>R: Keep until the next waking message
      else Claude Code or Codex waking message
        R->>T: Reach: deliver message and pending notices
      end
      R-->>S: Acknowledge acceptance
    end
  end
  Note over S,R: An acknowledgement is not the agent's reply.
  Note over A,T: Replies are new letters with reply_to set.
